  "notes": [
    {
      "id": "note_flags",
      "text": "The four toggles in the column grid are PK, NN, UQ and AI.\n\nPK implies NN. UQ is a constraint of its own, so isbn can be unique without being the key. AI only means anything on an integer column, and on PostgreSQL it is what turns BIGINT into BIGSERIAL.",
